ward", "url": "https://afsc.org/newsroom/nobel-peace-prize-2020-un-world-food-programme-winner-award"}, {"title": "odds 2020 nobel peace prize", "url": "https://www.citizen.co.za/south-coast-sun/news-headlines/2020/02/13/odds-2020-nobel-peace-prize/"}, {"title": "Nobel Peace Prize won by UN World Food Programme", "url": "https://www.itv.com/news/2020-10-09/nobel-peace-prize-won-by-un-world-food-programme"}, {"title": "next.sr.se", "url": "https://next.sr.se/artikel/7571253"}, {"title": "United Nations’ World Food Program wins 2020 Nobel Peace Prize", "url": "https://93qcountry.com/1007078/united-nations-world-food-program-wins-2020-nobel-peace-prize/"}, {"title": "acquiaprod.middleeasteye.net", "url": "https://acquiaprod.middleeasteye.net/node/187741"}, {"title": "Nobel Peace Prize Laureate 2020", "url": "https://preview.nobelpeacecenter.org/en/news/the-good-news-of-the-week-the-nobel-peace-prize-laureate-2020"}]}, "The 2020 Nobel Peace Prize went to the United Nations World Food Programme (WFP). The announcement came from Oslo, where the committee chair, Berit Reiss-Andersen, cited the agency's work against hunger. The WFP is the UN's food-assistance arm and the world's largest humanitarian organisation addressing hunger and promoting food security. The committee also tied the choice to the pandemic, saying COVID-19 had added to the hunger faced by millions and called on governments to fund WFP and other aid groups.\n\nThe field was large, with 318 candidates, of which 211 were individuals and 107 were organisations. Early favorites in the press included the World Health Organization and Greta Thunberg, and Jacinda Ardern was also tipped. Because of COVID-19 safety rules, the ceremony was held virtually."], "durationSeconds": 5.51712025, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_015rhnYNArGagspRK78eg3MF", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
